    {
      "id": "33fd3a7e-5052-4f4e-b0ad-735266ae3422",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue bistro ao tipo de lugar que ela descreve.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "882f4c4e-60a1-4f06-9ca8-cf8b391997e5",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Es un bistro tranquilo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>É um bistro tranquilo.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/93d5f57822834ce8842d0cc8e6dac064_b01-bistro-scene.png?Expires=1794099843&Signature=xCzGqNR6SNqM32o1ISmYs7w9~q7k2VIqU0mOKJGTAVPYthwro3N8F774Izw84NYIw-6JOijvr8mXX4rtkPIOeIQ2s~K9herhILdsKAQFfXcFDl2fV0Jn5PESlH7IpLXaQf4Y8aWkkcNmOlaacDBT2GncjzTr4zFjPtsgNBq-WELbCQSA6R~Kkqfdv4RL8yOulXqyqHzf5TBdpH88frbsmyIJNGB~t70OlJ7Z6rRHrTKcZW~ImROzbyZ-u5hDhvMSvbWNOIWwUO53QxTVcI9yW8rur0Rih9PYMUOEzW6q3~1JgDPF4OWeO1pZ8zk9Kw7lC2LiO6YDW7WEkUiKuXZEYg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
