    {
      "id": "6907275e-e631-43d8-b02f-655d4d3bd027",
      "title": "Leia a nota e compare o tipo de ambiente que taberna sugere.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e876b5c7-22c6-4040-b8fb-a63c0e33e5ef",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>taberna</strong> costuma puxar a cena para algo mais informal, mais direto e mais coletivo.</p><p>Em relação a <strong>bistro</strong>, a palavra sugere menos contenção e mais movimento na sala.</p><p>Ela é útil quando o lugar importa tanto quanto o prato para entender a experiência.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a7a2ffee-feeb-418e-954f-3a01e8e0a4b4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e note que o comentário agora não fala do lugar, e sim do trato da equipe.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8d27aa0f-feb8-444b-a07a-28518e86dc60",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena e escute a frase.</p><p><strong>Tiene un servicio atento.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tem um serviço atencioso.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/774dc23c287e4587a399808380483661_b05-servicio-atento-scene.png?Expires=1794099843&Signature=E-JvNH9VoJD-7DvQ9Cs2GSgglMUyqzVes2qdFBDTi01kMwjs0f7xZIa2krUi-S9nmdStBuLUwpIK9AXrm0Zdap8gw1AxD8BnYhN9snSqrjJMJA-L4H~QqQqMLmW6OrTvJN~GteFpeAqh~rLecSE0MJnjrqEqIZZ8~Rsrl0He6nPXa2V99sgXowZWxJtkhbdFEOAi-Cy48Gzdt9ydo97RCUivQ-VOwX2Q8HBZCUwTH0H85Rqcaa6Vvl1MX9dS15ipRSYkelpEo~RIF7i5~bEKbaJY1nYmG88snbqQtVXQPbTpOlFUG9fttIyU6pvj5XTv3WdwjdJHvRCVpWyYuHkvEg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/edf92eb3230c4725881c8cc6b2c1cfbd_b05-tiene-un-servicio-atento.mp3?Expires=1794099843&Signature=AbE2G2vJX5M33FMMEo-NdYb0pGQ0XvLk2LoifW-mLP6ImeDk2C~JcliGtK9tLvbVE-bRei~~HcjF0H-hL2mbmOr1nbFj6w6DFcs4gyAX7aD3IHMP1W9~ZqeJIXDvJM6HJdXByuW-Ap8CfKLUwLDqvCIj7LzwNUpSrKqWy7Sf69t8bN0d7AUvFiSKZoHr3Ll8HkLm33XziVR4ahS-EZd98vUu9L8SpwzowIBVTo6H6I2qR4ai6i6150x~1iAzuOksvSLM~BvH68FCoH4Pak5fLmaA2F~2-vCV9F-a9k19QAipvTv08Q1W9Jcg6wlp~nahGaVSDbIIdDjlEkbG5vGL9g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
